      "content": "thanks but it doesnt feel like small moments of authenticity change anything. the truth is i feel more like a ghost than a person. i watch people interact and it's like they're all speaking a language i'll never learn. it's just... the effort of being \"here\" is getting way too much. like i'm just running on empty and there's nothing left to fill it with.",
